{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00222",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 4.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a few minutes behind, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.87,
      "end_seconds": 8.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.84,
      "end_seconds": 24.95,
      "duration_seconds": 15.11,
      "text": "Mainly I've been getting breathless walking short distances. That's why I came. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.4,
      "end_seconds": 29.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "So, is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.25,
      "end_seconds": 32.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "For two years, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.51,
      "end_seconds": 36.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.85,
      "end_seconds": 43.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly. I've also had a feeling that I can't take a deep breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.81,
      "end_seconds": 46.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.13,
      "end_seconds": 52.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.58,
      "end_seconds": 58.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.83,
      "end_seconds": 61.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "No. None of those, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.45,
      "end_seconds": 63.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Any leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.45,
      "end_seconds": 66.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "No. No leg swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.62,
      "end_seconds": 69.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.87,
      "end_seconds": 72.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.13,
      "end_seconds": 92.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.72,
      "end_seconds": 96.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Yes, eggs, it gives me stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.9,
      "end_seconds": 101.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.12,
      "end_seconds": 102.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.0,
      "end_seconds": 113.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Okay, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.69,
      "end_seconds": 120.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.02,
      "end_seconds": 124.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.83,
      "end_seconds": 126.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.49,
      "end_seconds": 133.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "So, are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.35,
      "end_seconds": 136.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.35,
      "end_seconds": 140.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just typing this up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.97,
      "end_seconds": 159.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Right, carry on. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.51,
      "end_seconds": 162.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.49,
      "end_seconds": 166.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.03,
      "end_seconds": 169.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.46,
      "end_seconds": 184.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "No clubbing in the fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.15,
      "end_seconds": 187.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.6,
      "end_seconds": 202.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "There are fine crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.69,
      "end_seconds": 216.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.31,
      "end_seconds": 228.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "Oh, yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.95,
      "end_seconds": 236.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.41,
      "end_seconds": 241.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I mean, is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.32,
      "end_seconds": 262.73,
      "duration_seconds": 20.41,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up, and we'll know more once the an echocardiogram is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been getting breathless walking short distances for two years, moderate, and no leg swelling or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.97,
      "end_seconds": 266.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Yes, you know, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.7,
      "end_seconds": 270.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I'm going to order an echocardiogram, for breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.97,
      "end_seconds": 273.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.23,
      "end_seconds": 290.29,
      "duration_seconds": 16.06,
      "text": "Try a daily walk and note how far you get before you need to stop. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.18,
      "end_seconds": 291.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.5,
      "end_seconds": 299.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Come back after the results are back. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.95,
      "end_seconds": 305.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.18,
      "end_seconds": 313.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.55,
      "end_seconds": 316.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    }
  ]
}